// Let binding: name: type <- rhs; body. Check rhs has declared type, add to env, check body.
// Reject unit for named variables; allow _ : unit <- expr (discard pattern for expression statements).
// Memory region types (ref, region, buf) are validated before type checking.
// Untyped `name <- rhs` (empty annotation) is a type error (E2018), not a parse defect.
